{"question": "CW / CCW 槳葉怎麼判斷？", "answer_short": "CW 是順時針槳，CCW 是逆時針槳。F450 要依馬達旋轉方向交叉安裝，不能只看外形猜。", "aliases": ["CW / CCW 槳葉如何判斷？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "source_ref": "Q1", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_2ef5a934231f"}
{"question": "槳葉或馬達方向低分怎麼辦？", "answer_short": "先停機，不要通電、不要解鎖。拆槳後檢查馬達序號、馬達轉向、槳葉標示、飛控箭頭與接線方向，再請老師確認。", "aliases": ["槳葉或馬達方向低分如何辦？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "source_ref": "Q2", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_dde60b026211"}
{"question": "起飛會翻通常先查什麼？", "answer_short": "先查飛控箭頭是否朝機頭、馬達序號是否對、CW/CCW 槳葉是否裝對、電調訊號線是否插到正確輸出口。未確認前不要裝槳測試。", "aliases": ["升空會翻通常先查什麼？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "source_ref": "Q3", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\09_F450_FAQ_快速排錯.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_7bc120886f96"}
{"question": "CW / CCW 是什麼？", "answer_short": "CW 是順時針槳，CCW 是逆時針槳。F450 不能四個位置裝同一種槳，要依馬達旋轉方向交叉安裝。", "aliases": [], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q1", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_76670065cf53"}
{"question": "槳葉正反怎麼判斷？", "answer_short": "先看槳葉標示和弧面。槳葉有方向，不能上下反裝；", "aliases": ["槳葉正反如何判斷？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q2", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_12b3dff54a8f"}
{"question": "M1 到 M4 怎麼檢查？", "answer_short": "逐一檢查 M1、M2、M3、M4：馬達序號是否對、馬達轉向是否對、槳葉 CW/CCW 是否對、槳葉正反面是否對。不要只看單一專案。", "aliases": ["M1 到 M4 如何檢查？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q3", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_56a7c423020a"}
{"question": "分數低於 90 怎麼辦？", "answer_short": "80 到 89 是 CHECK，需要複查異常馬達位。低於 80 是 NG，不要進入下一步；", "aliases": ["分數低於 90 如何辦？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q4", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_a41bb1920d23"}
{"question": "檢測出 M3 正反 ERROR 怎麼回答？", "answer_short": "M3 槳葉正反面異常。先停機，不要通電或解鎖；", "aliases": ["檢測出 M3 正反 ERROR 如何回答？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q5", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_a7c676ef21a9"}
{"question": "檢測出 M2 CW/CCW ERROR 怎麼回答？", "answer_short": "M2 的 CW/CCW 型別可能裝錯。先拆槳，確認 M2 馬達實際旋轉方向，再換成對應的 CW 或 CCW 槳葉。", "aliases": ["檢測出 M2 CW/CCW ERROR 如何回答？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q6", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_3a136715d8fd"}
{"question": "起飛會翻先查什麼？", "answer_short": "先查飛控箭頭是否朝機頭，再查 M1 到 M4 馬達序號、馬達轉向、CW/CCW 槳葉型別和槳葉正反面。未確認前不要裝槳測試。", "aliases": ["升空會翻先查什麼？"], "topic": "槳葉與馬達", "source_type": "faq", "source_name": "10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "source_ref": "Q7", "source_path": "E:\\FDE_AI_Voice_RAG\\knowledge_base\\10_F450_IG_FAQ_CW_CCW_v2.md", "priority": 95, "review_status": "approved", "needs_review": false, "id": "f450_qa_06f812271cd2"}
